\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186678655 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08b72347-1d8d-50a3-bb44-5acc1af00891" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678602} {:answer/id #uuid "2dbcb0f3-a228-5d97-abb5-a77410bb0322" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678626} {:answer/id #uuid "a56b2967-5d58-588f-8aa2-576b19eb8329" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "4\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678697} {:answer/id #uuid "ea9ec55f-b898-5c90-bac0-6ffe3c9144b0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678746} {:answer/id #uuid "f90e2aa8-2afe-56fc-9184-76c2d0bf9936" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678760}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186678746} :answer-field/id #uuid "b5f52558-6f4e-5657-8e84-5a29f96489e9" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678709}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "52f1aee4-b8af-504c-92b3-9b4debebc7db" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{25 - 4 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant." :question/retired true :que