{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186682792 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "24601395-e4e4-59b1-abf0-cfaf01dd7ea2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186682800} {:answer/id #uuid "2f42d6d6-d2be-515f-ac77-c101214b636b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{12}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186682805} {:answer/id #uuid "350131d3-cb87-5a0f-9040-431d757679bd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186682808} {:answer/id #uuid "ec1237d2-3423-536d-a6fa-c64637028cc9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186682888} {:answer/id #uuid "fe1180dc-4920-51d6-9670-31158d24fc43" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186682893}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186682893} :answer-field/id #uuid "5dbd93c8-e4a5-5efb-9c09-224f560f30a2" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186682824}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "1319d74d-edf9-57c5-a8c2-0e37322fa344" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{9 x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant." :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{3 x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{3}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n9 x^{2} + 4=4\\left(1+(\\frac{3 x}{2})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{2}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{2}{3}=\\frac{1}{6}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{9 x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186682793 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "21343440-38fa-54ad-b278-e8aa58dc4c0a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186682797} {:answer/id #uuid "4898b84d-1641-5c33-a00c-69e55665e754" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "3\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186682813} {:answer/id #uuid "82a465f5-2552-59b2-9090-6c6918738ae2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "3\\left(\\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186682843} {:answer/id #uuid "dbeb02c4-3082-575e-8429-fe6b148437da" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "- \\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186682880} {:answer/id #uuid "dfd71781-3aea-548a-a066-1db8196a4e93" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186682883}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186682883} :answer-field/id #uuid "aa8d3463-8288-5beb-86c5-2dfa9d9d11d3"