}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "18a9fd9d-430c-577b-abda-f26c7a09fc10" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+\\frac{5}{x}y=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x}{{x}^{4}},\\,x>0.\n$$\n\nSelect the correct options below.$\\,$ An integrating factor for this equation is $I(x)=$ {{field-1}}.\n\n$\\,$ The general solution is given by $y(x)=$ {{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "This equation is in the standard form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+P(x)y=Q(x)\n$$\n\nwith $P(x)=\\frac{5}{x}$ and $Q(x)=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x}{{x}^{4}}.$ We proceed to find an integrating factor $I(x)$ using the definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I(x) & ={e}^{\\int P(x)\\,\\text{d}x} \\\\  & ={e}^{\\int (5/x)\\,\\text{d}x} \\\\  & ={e}^{5\\operatorname{ln}⁡x} \\\\  & ={x}^{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we multiply our differential equation through by $I(x)={x}^{5}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{5}\\cdot (\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+\\frac{5}{x}y) & ={x}^{5}\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x}{{x}^{4}} \\\\ {x}^{5}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+5{x}^{4}y & =x\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we rewrite the left hand side as $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(y\\cdot I(x))$ and carry out the integration:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(y{x}^{5}) & =x\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x \\\\ \\int \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(y{x}^{5})\\text{d}x & =\\int x\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo solve this integral, we integrate by parts. \n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int {u}^{′}v\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\nLet $u=x,{u}^{′}=1,{v}^{′}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x,$ and $v=-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x}{2}.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y{x}^{5} & =\\int x\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y{x}^{5} & =x(-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x}{2})-\\int (-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x}{2})\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y{x}^{5} & =x(-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x}{2})+\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x}{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y{x}^{5} & =-\\frac{x\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x}{2}+\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x}{4}\\,+C \\\\ y & =\\frac{\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x}{{x}^{5}}}{4}-\\frac{\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x}{{x}^{4}}}{2}+\\frac{C}{{x}^{5}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186686893 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "52a7f4fa-60da-5a4c-aa9f-6f10e93bfedb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{C}{x^{4}} + \\frac{\\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2 x^{2}} + \\frac{\\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4 x^{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186686903} {:answer/id #uuid "60d2aea3-0080-515e-af29-9a16cd13adb4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{C}{x^{3}} + \\frac{\\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2 x^{2}} + \\frac{\\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4 x^{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186686904} {:answer/id #uuid "69aea9eb-7b8f-51da-b078-3bf9e1873fa4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{C}{x^{3}} + \\frac{\\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2 x^{2}} - \\frac{\\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4 x^{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186686907} {:answer/id #uuid "d1526efd-e3da-5cde-9dd0-1c9d776c6620" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{C}{x^{4}} + \\frac{\\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2 x^{2}} - \\frac{\\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4 x^{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186686925}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186686904} :answer-field/id #uuid "1eba6452-d82f-5730-84ce-8ddb734bc242" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186686892} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "50d148b8-fc5f-5720-9164-e27a609c842b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "x^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186686902} {:answer/id #uuid "7fd62529-fc77-5eb6-80bb-9c681679c00f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "x^{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 