t{d}}{\\text{d}x}(y{x}^{3})\\text{d}x & =\\int x\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo solve this integral, we integrate by parts. \n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int {u}^{′}v\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\nLet $u=x,{u}^{′}=1,{v}^{′}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x,$ and $v=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x}{2}.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y{x}^{3} & =\\int x\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y{x}^{3} & =x(\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x}{2})-\\int (\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x}{2})\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y{x}^{3} & =x(\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x}{2})-\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x}{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y{x}^{3} & =\\frac{x\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x}{2}+\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x}{4}\\,+C \\\\ y & =\\frac{\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x}{{x}^{3}}}{4}+\\frac{\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x}{{x}^{2}}}{2}+\\frac{C}{{x}^{3}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186686897 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "79ea2e72-b64b-50cc-af67-0648c20f1f92" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "x^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186686909} {:answer/id #uuid "8290a9f4-f2fe-5e77-9534-d7f872413b1d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "x^{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186686913} {:answer/id #uuid "c9ae3206-0779-5780-a7bf-218e90f1fc6a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "x^{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186686923} {:answer/id #uuid "d2edb5ac-4cfe-5370-86a7-dc8f622c185a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "x^{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186686926}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186686926} :answer-field/id #uuid "716f9894-975a-528c-8e46-1217b4b55774" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186686908} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3ba6de06-2dfe-57c4-a02f-47c1431afdb3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{C}{x^{7}} + \\frac{\\cos{\\left(