0f36b-36bc-58d7-b9a9-caae29de478c" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691913} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a0951a3b-9be7-51bd-b65d-4b5024a9e9af" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "e^{10 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691932} {:answer/id #uuid "b44e8a49-ed00-55a5-a16a-cf838aef094d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "e^{- 5 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691937} {:answer/id #uuid "d48f11ae-467e-5dc2-9c9f-1c4af59a7034" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "e^{- 10 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691942} {:answer/id #uuid "e18732c1-7b2f-50e4-aba5-a8be3d31eb7c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "e^{5 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691948}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186691948} :answer-field/id #uuid "767af81c-9b38-50f4-b4ec-f78ad1f68768" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691923} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "551e851e-cafd-5ec7-910b-97dbe7745035" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "(5 y + 3)\\,\\text{d}x+\\,\\text{d}y=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691908} {:answer/id #uuid "5bc2e17d-85e5-5f65-a456-0e4e9f8c2c88" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "(-3)\\,\\text{d}x+\\,\\text{d}y=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691914} {:answer/id #uuid "8b8bf8a0-a86b-50e3-adf9-a30e8337e7a7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\,\\text{d}x-(- 5 y)\\,\\text{d}y=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691928} {:answer/id #uuid "dd518b5e-5f54-5aeb-9cff-adcf4ff49fe0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\,\\text{d}x-(- 5 y - 3)\\,\\text{d}y=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691947}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186691908} :answer-field/id #uuid "b7d1f776-ef6f-5925-bfdd-0c9ca7392e75" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691938}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "04a68063-6cfa-551c-8e91-c4fcdeb81150" :question/problem "Find an **integrating factor** depending on $x$ alone that makes the equation exact:\n\n$$\ny'=- 5 y - 3\n$$\n\nUse the differential form obtained by moving the right-hand side to the left and multiplying by $\\text{d}x$, without dividing by the coefficient of $y'$. In this form, $P$ is the coefficient of $\\text{d}x$ and $Q$ is the coefficient of $\\text{d}y$. Take $x$ to be real and choose the multiplicative constant to be one.\n\nDifferential form:\n\n$$\n{{field-1}}\n$$\n\nCompute the quotient:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{Q}(\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}-\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x})={{field-2}}\n$$\n\nAn integrating factor is\n\n$$\nI(x)={{field-3}}\n$$\n\nand multiplication gives the exact equation\n\n$$\n{{field-4}}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a differential equation of the form\n\n$$\nP(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x+Q(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y=0\n$$\n\nif\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{Q}(\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}-\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x})=g(x)\n$$\n\nwhere $g(x)$ is independent of $y$, an integrating factor is\n\n$$\nI(x)=\\exp(\\int g(x)\\,\\text{d}x)\n$$.\n\nHere $\\exp(x)=e^x$.\n\nFirst, rewrite our equation in differential form:\n\n$$\n(5 y + 3)\\,\\text{d}x+\\,\\text{d}y=0\n$$\n\nLet's denote\n\n$$\nP(x,y)=5 y + 3,\\qquad Q(x,y)=1\n$$\n\nCompute the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}&=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial y}(5 y + 3)=5 \\\\ \\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}&=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x}(1)=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{Q}(\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}-\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x})&=\\frac{1}{1}(5-(0)) \\\\ &=5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is a function of $x$ only. Choose the multiplicative constant to be one. Thus\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I(x)&=\\exp(\\int (5)\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\ &=\\exp(5 x) \\\\ &=e^{5 x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiply the original differential equation by this integrating factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I(x)((5 y + 3)\\,\\text{d}x+\\,\\text{d}y)&=I(x)\\cdot 0 \\\\ e^{5 x}((5 y + 3)\\,\\text{d}x+\\,\\text{d}y)&=0\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186691905 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "29b98dc8-7e5c-50b0-aa41-a8060b1b2e58" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "e^{3 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691899} {:answer/id #uuid "68a0089c-112d-591e-a92c-5e9c8a97f7be" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "e^{\\frac{3 x}{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691919} {:answer/id #uuid "b27f0926-79d8-5f8c-a1fb-c5bc00321eb8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "e^{- \\frac{3 x}{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691936} {:answer/id #uuid "fe7c2063-ef12-59a8-8107-7de13cb99d59" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "e^{- 3 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691952}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186691899} :answer-field/id #uuid "00ed66d1-e53f-5e41-9c49-dd4d05c596f3" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691890} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "25bcbbb7-f796-528a-bb3c-df3a914ed3f8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "e^{- 3 x}((3 y - 2)\\,\\text{d}x+\\,\\text{d}y)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691898} {:answer/id #uuid "594152e8-98a3-58c8-918f-f5c87ae486a2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "e^{- \\frac{3 x}{2}}((3 y - 2)\\,\\text{d}x+\\,\\text{d}y)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691912} {:answer/id #uuid "630a8b79-018d-599e-8fe7-9488a6c2c05b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "e^{3 x}((3 y - 2)\\,\\text{d}x+\\,\\text{d}y)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691917} {:answer/id #uuid "6f7c37fb-98f7-5b71-ae59-baf6c71e241e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "e^{\\frac{3 x}{2}}((3 y