only. Choose the multiplicative constant to be one. Thus\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I(x)&=\\exp(\\int (3)\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\ &=\\exp(3 x) \\\\ &=e^{3 x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiply the original differential equation by this integrating factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I(x)((3 y - 2)\\,\\text{d}x+\\,\\text{d}y)&=I(x)\\cdot 0 \\\\ e^{3 x}((3 y - 2)\\,\\text{d}x+\\,\\text{d}y)&=0\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186691943 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "65488a7e-d0fa-57e0-8d1e-db17919fe5c1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "x^{- \\frac{1}{2}}((- 5 x^{2})\\,\\text{d}x+4 x\\,\\text{d}y)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691918} {:answer/id #uuid "6fba6080-e79b-5ab5-8dbe-a55f72ba186c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{x}((- 5 x^{2})\\,\\text{d}x+4 x\\,\\text{d}y)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691921} {:answer/id #uuid "84ad8daa-88d6-5f3e-9de1-9836f847a302" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "x((- 5 x^{2})\\,\\text{d}x+4 x\\,\\text{d}y)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691927} {:answer/id #uuid "da8ccaf0-9bdc-51ff-929c-062e176f2b9e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "x^{\\frac{1}{2}}((- 5 x^{2})\\,\\text{d}x+4 x\\,\\text{d}y)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691944}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186691921} :answer-field/id #uuid "19654b5c-dc9a-5585-a53a-43ba62fa9272" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691897} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2a027090-8959-5364-a2d2-92b3d75543a7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "(- 5 x^{2})\\,\\text{d}x+\\,\\text{d}y=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691900} {:answer/id #uuid "4867045c-b3ab-5f29-a619-775691a5a97a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "(- 5 x^{2})\\,\\text{d}x+4 x\\,\\text{d}y=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691906} {:answer/id #uuid "6178a188-1517-5a8a-8c98-c94f