m{d}u=(\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=2\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{2})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\cdot 2=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2 \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186692665 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "15233785-ebbb-5b04-888c-39145e613120" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "2 \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{8} \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186692564} {:answer/id #uuid "1897b663-b2c1-5a67-9f34-25c67e78c376" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "- \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{4} \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186692565} {:answer/id #uuid "1adc8a3d-9021-5260-bfe3-000b99e0b5ad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{4} \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186692567} {:answer/id #uuid "75969d94-6458-5e28-822f-3e18a703e7f4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{8} \\right)}}{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186692631} {:answer/id #uuid "97d9c546-0c6a-5900-9eb2-0aec26062516" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}}{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186692647}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186692567} :answer-field/id #uuid "68290687-2cc3-5aca-bbb6-878af00c10b6" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/id #ed