$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 9=9\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{3})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=3\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot 3=\\frac{2}{3}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186692721 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "29475adf-ec17-56dc-acf2-8dd76bc22b26" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\arctan{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186692746} {:answer/id #uuid "aa7022a6-11f7-5a7a-b947-4b27582eb0ea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186692823} {:answer/id #uuid "c03f290d-b30e-5203-8be3-22295789bf5e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "2 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{3} \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186692840} {:answer/id #uuid "ed0a1220-6d75-56aa-a4d0-7a93088e90a4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}}{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186692872} {:answer/id #uuid "effd7907-54b3-5254-b573-307dbbd3a259" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{6} \\right)}}{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186692875}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186692823} :answer-field/id #uuid "24ec913b-1c30-513f-8df0-66db690316b4" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 1759