sfies these conditions. The omitted planar component is zero: $\\ln(x-1)\\,\\mathbf i+0\\,\\mathbf j=\\langle\\ln(x-1),0\\rangle$. Its output is still planar. The inputs and outputs are planar, so select this function.\n\n- **III.** $B$ The components require $x-1\\ne0,\\ y\\geq0$. Every point in the stated domain satisfies these conditions. The square-root boundary $y=0$ is allowed when $x-1\\ne0$.  The inputs and outputs are planar, so select this function.\n\nSelect II, III only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186707495 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6c439e96-0377-50d4-a7af-4895e546b673" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707489} {:answer/id #uuid "df0bf835-376a-5025-8812-2c80f4fd9c38" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707517}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186707489} :answer-field/id #uuid "88ea6a6c-91a0-54bc-b703-cb6847059b9b" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707497} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "504b9475-89dd-5a30-90c3-f87bb65635cf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707485} {:answer/id #uuid "abcaaaa9-c1ee-563d-a4a7-81074edda576" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707506}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186707506} :answer-field/id #uuid "b33167b7-c792-5521-b8b6-c060924b0d76" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707507} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6b225ad2-8aed-5a8a-9ea7-737b8662460e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707488} {:answer/id #uuid "da970778-204d-582c-9661-25ade4a1f096" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186