 has domain $[-1,1]$, range $[-\\pi/2,\\pi/2]$, the same endpoints, and increases through $(0,0)$. Use the marked interior point." :question/worked-solution "Reflection in $y=x$ swaps coordinates:\n\n$$\n(-\\frac{\\pi}{6},-1/2)\\longmapsto(-1/2,-\\frac{\\pi}{6}).\n$$\n\nThe blanks are $-1/2$ and $-\\frac{\\pi}{6}$. The endpoints reflect to $(-1,-\\pi/2)$ and $(1,\\pi/2)$. Endpoint and direction checks alone do not distinguish these candidates. At $x=-1/2$, only the graph below has height $-\\frac{\\pi}{6}$; it follows the reflected sine curve. The other graphs place the marked interior point too high or too low.\n\n![](images/31/31da885dac479c66b7e8d7b16681510671cd6c71d9f0bcc68d1af93764775358.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186716513 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c5349369-c6dd-5fc7-b5d2-d5cf2214b50a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\pi}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186716531}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186716531} :answer-field/id #uuid "34c8b7ef-fa5f-579d-bff0-117b88fdc22b" :answer-field/key "point-y" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186716506} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e3b2e24e-8459-5a4c-acb3-1749a4147e3e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186716544}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186716544} :answer-field/id #uuid "6f13f18e-e9ac-5fdb-a8e1-0e2a45d6e9b3" :answer-field/key "point-x" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186716520} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "34747487-84e8-58cb-8264-2e16ff23dbb8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/7a/7ac9eaf9da5cd4042024f57a05730f94aecfa962c366b78eba83bed932878dbc.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186716505} {:answer/id #uuid "5ca0cbd8-e718-53ac-80bd-e97de62fee62" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/eb/ebd