]$, $[- \\frac{1}{2},\\frac{3}{2})$. The horizontal line $y=0$ meets pieces $1$ and $2$ at different inputs. The function is not invertible.\n\n- **Graph II:** Each piece is strictly monotone. From left to right, the output ranges are $(-3,-1]$, $(0,3]$. These ranges are disjoint, including endpoint membership. Thus no output is repeated across pieces, and the function is invertible.\n\n- **Graph III:** Each piece is strictly monotone. From left to right, the output ranges are $[- \\frac{1}{2},\\frac{5}{2})$, $[- \\frac{5}{2},\\frac{1}{2})$. The horizontal line $y=0$ meets pieces $1$ and $2$ at different inputs. The function is not invertible.\n\n- **Graph IV:** Each piece is strictly monotone. From left to right, the output ranges are $[- \\frac{3}{2},\\frac{1}{2}]$, $[- \\frac{1}{2},\\frac{3}{2}]$. The horizontal line $y=0$ meets pieces $1$ and $2$ at different inputs. The function is not invertible.\n\nSelect **Graph II**."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186743191 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "dca80c33-b4f4-5570-a584-b02d2341dd63" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186743199} {:answer/id #uuid "f050dc17-ecc8-5787-a91d-688048ca93ba" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186743209}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186743199} :answer-field/id #uuid "7953a757-fbbe-54a3-806f-4e4cc8d6508c" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186743171} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4adbbe53-ab64-5ab4-a50c-d2e8ffaf8fce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186743150} {:answer/id #uuid "59170c1f-4548-5521-9874-0d7074b9bae8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186743157}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186743150} :answer-field/id #uuid "79f717e